        "F-001",
        "Object Distance Distribution",
        "RadarControl publishes ObjectDistance through IRadarObjects. PerceptionManager receives the signal through RadarObjects_In and updates its internal state model."
      ],
      [
        "F-002",
        "Lane Offset Distribution",
        "CameraControl publishes LaneOffset through ILaneDetection. PerceptionManager receives the signal through LaneDetection_In and updates its internal state model."
