        "Steering Angle Command Distribution",
        "LaneKeepControl publishes SteeringAngleCommand through ISteeringCorrection. PerceptionManager receives the signal through SteeringCorrection_In and updates its internal state model."
      ],
      [
        "F-005",
        "Warning Level Distribution",
        "PerceptionManager publishes WarningLevel through IDriverWarning. WarningManager receives the signal through DriverWarning_In and updates its internal state model."
